    body: "<!-- TEMPLATE — requires attorney review before launch -->\n\n# Legal Disclaimers\n\nThe following disclaimers apply to all use of the {{LEGAL_ENTITY_NAME}} platform. Please read carefully.\n\n## Software Tool Only — Not a Service Provider\n\n{{LEGAL_ENTITY_NAME}} provides software tools to help you manage your real estate investment business. We are a technology company, not a real estate company. The platform:\n\n- Automates outreach and communication workflows\n- Provides templates and tools for contract management\n- Offers AI-powered features for message drafting and negotiation\n- Aggregates property and market data for your reference\n\n**We do not act on your behalf in any capacity.** Every action taken through the platform is your action.\n\n## Not a Real Estate Brokerage\n\n**{{LEGAL_ENTITY_NAME}} is not a licensed real estate brokerage, agent, or broker.** We do not:\n\n- Buy, sell, list, or represent any real property\n- Represent any party in a real estate transaction\n- Provide real estate brokerage services of any kind\n- Hold ourselves out as real estate professionals\n- Receive commissions or fees based on transactions you complete\n\nIf you need real estate brokerage services, you should work with a licensed real estate professional in your jurisdiction.\n\n## Not Legal Advice\n\n**Nothing on this platform constitutes legal advice.** The platform and all content, including contract templates, disclaimers, and compliance guidance, are provided for informational purposes only and should not be relied upon as legal advice.\n\n- Contract templates may not comply with your jurisdiction's requirements\n- Compliance information may be incomplete or outdated\n- Legal requirements vary by state, county, and municipality\n- Only a licensed attorney can provide legal advice specific to your situation\n\n**Always consult a licensed attorney** before entering into any contract, conducting real estate transactions, or relying on any compliance guidance.\n\n## Not Financial or Investment Advice\n\n**Nothing on this platform constitutes financial or investment advice.** We do not:\n\n- Recommend specific investments or transactions\n- Provide tax advice\n- Guarantee returns or profitability\n- Evaluate the financial suitability of any opportunity for you\n\n**Always consult licensed professionals** (financial advisors, accountants, tax professionals) for financial decisions.\n\n## No Earnings Guarantee\n\nSuccess in real estate investing and wholesaling depends on many factors including:\n\n- Market conditions and timing\n- Your skill, effort, and experience\n- Available capital and financing\n- Local regulations and restrictions\n- Property conditions and valuations\n- Buyer and seller motivations\n\n**Past performance does not guarantee future results.** Any examples, case studies, or testimonials represent individual experiences and are not guarantees of similar outcomes. We make no guarantee of deals, revenue, profit, or any specific results.\n\nReal estate investing involves risk, including the risk of loss. You should only invest capital you can afford to lose.\n\n## Your Compliance Responsibility\n\n**You are solely responsible for complying with all applicable laws** in every jurisdiction where you operate. This includes but is not limited to:\n\n### Messaging Compliance\n- Telephone Consumer Protection Act (TCPA)\n- CAN-SPAM Act\n- State telemarketing laws\n- Do-not-call regulations\n- CTIA messaging guidelines\n\n### Real Estate Compliance\n- State real estate licensing laws\n- Wholesaling and assignment regulations\n- Disclosure requirements\n- Contract law requirements\n- Recording and registration requirements\n\n### Fair Housing Compliance\n- Federal Fair Housing Act\n- State and local fair housing laws\n- Equal opportunity requirements\n- Anti-discrimination requirements\n\n**Laws vary significantly by jurisdiction.** What is legal in one state may be prohibited in another. It is your responsibility to understand and comply with the laws that apply to your specific activities.\n\n## Contract Templates Are Examples Only\n\nAny contract templates, forms, or documents provided through the platform:\n\n- Are general examples that may not fit your specific needs\n- May not comply with your state or local requirements\n- May become outdated as laws change\n- Are not a substitute for documents prepared by a licensed attorney\n- Should be reviewed and modified by qualified legal counsel before use\n\n**You are solely responsible for ensuring any contract you use is valid, enforceable, and compliant with applicable law.**\n\n## Property Data and Valuations\n\nProperty information displayed on the platform, including valuations and estimates, is:\n\n- Compiled from third-party sources and public records\n- Provided for informational purposes only\n- Not guaranteed for accuracy or completeness\n- Not an appraisal or professional valuation\n- Not a substitute for professional inspection or due diligence\n\n**Always conduct your own due diligence** and obtain professional inspections, appraisals, and title searches before entering into any transaction.\n\n## AI-Generated Content\n\nContent generated by AI features (including message drafts, responses, and suggestions):\n\n- Is generated by artificial intelligence and may contain errors\n- Should be reviewed and edited before use\n- Does not constitute professional advice of any kind\n- May not be appropriate for your specific situation\n- Is your responsibility once you send or use it\n\n**You are responsible for all content you send**, regardless of whether it was AI-generated.\n\n## Fair Housing Statement\n\n{{LEGAL_ENTITY_NAME}} is committed to compliance with the Fair Housing Act and all applicable fair housing laws. We do not discriminate based on race, color, religion, national origin, sex, familial status, disability, or any other protected class.\n\nWe expect all users to comply with fair housing laws in their marketing, communications, and transactions. Discriminatory use of our platform is strictly prohibited and may result in immediate account termination.\n\n## Equal Opportunity Statement\n\nWe are an equal opportunity platform provider. We do not discriminate in the provision of services based on race, color, religion, national origin, sex, familial status, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, or any other protected characteristic.\n\n## Third-Party Links and Services\n\nThe platform may contain links to third-party websites and services. We do not control and are not responsible for the content, privacy policies, or practices of third-party sites. Inclusion of any link does not imply endorsement.\n\n## Limitation of Liability\n\nTo the maximum extent permitted by law, {{LEGAL_ENTITY_NAME}} disclaims all liability for:\n\n- Your transactions with third parties\n- Accuracy of property data or valuations\n- Legal sufficiency of any template or document\n- Compliance of your activities with applicable law\n- Results of your use of the platform\n- Actions of contacts, buyers, sellers, or other parties\n\n## Questions\n\nIf you have questions about these disclaimers or your legal obligations, please:\n\n1. Consult a licensed attorney in your jurisdiction\n2. Contact us at {{SUPPORT_EMAIL}} for platform-related questions\n\n**This document does not constitute legal advice.** For legal questions, consult a licensed attorney.\n",
