    body: "<!-- TEMPLATE — requires attorney review before launch -->\n\n# Electronic Records & Signature Consent (E-SIGN / UETA)\n\nThis disclosure is presented, and your affirmative consent is recorded, **before** you enter any electronic-signature flow on the platform operated by {{LEGAL_ENTITY_NAME}}.\n\n## Consent to Electronic Records\n\nBy affirmatively consenting, you agree that electronic signatures and records have the same legal effect as handwritten signatures and paper documents under the federal E-SIGN Act and applicable state UETA.\n\n## Hardware & Software Requirements\n\nTo access and retain electronic records you need an internet-connected device, a current web browser, a valid email address, and the ability to view and download PDF documents.\n\n## Withdrawing Consent\n\nYou may withdraw consent to electronic records by contacting {{SUPPORT_EMAIL}}. Withdrawal does not invalidate documents you already signed electronically.\n\n## Retaining Copies\n\nWe recommend downloading and saving every signed document. Copies remain available in your account while it is active.\n",
